  "score_rationale": "Nokia trades at ~$15.63 against a DCF intrinsic value of $6.91, implying ~55% overvaluation on base-case assumptions; even generous bull-case DCF adjustments (WACC -150bps, terminal growth +200bps) struggle to close more than half this gap, while the consensus price target of $14.00 itself implies negative 10.4% downside from current levels, confirming broad analyst recognition of stretched valuation.",
